I arrive at Priya's building.
It is a very beautiful place.
I go to the fourth floor by lift.
I ring Priya's doorbell.
In just a few seconds, she opens the door.
She welcomes me with a big smile.
Priya says, "Maya, welcome!"
"Come inside."
"I am very happy that you came today."
I go inside and say, "Thank you very much for inviting me, Priya."
I give her the box of sweets.
I say, "I brought Kaju Katli for you."
Priya takes the box and says happily, "Oh wow!"
"This is my favorite sweet."
I think that she likes Kaju Katli very much.
Priya says, "We will definitely eat this after dinner."
"Come on, let's go inside now and sit comfortably."
I put my bag down.
I think that we will have a lot of fun this evening.
